{
  "_file": "Candidate Hypothesis Catalogue. Per FC_RCA_RCA_Methodology.md §12 the catalogue is VERSIONED CONFIGURATION, NOT CODE — new hypotheses are added here with their applicability conditions, never by editing the engine. The catalogue version is recorded on every RCA.",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "_condition_grammar": {
    "note": "Every condition is {feature, op, value} evaluated against the feature vector rca_engine.py computes from the source data. No condition contains a literal narrative string. ops: gt gte lt lte eq ne in not_in abs_gt abs_gte present absent",
    "applicable_when": "ALL conditions must hold, else the hypothesis is NOT GENERATED and the failing condition is recorded.",
    "suppressed_when": "Checked BEFORE testing. If ALL hold, state = Suppressed (could not be tested) — distinct from Rejected.",
    "accepted_when": "ALL conditions must hold for state = Accepted. Otherwise Rejected.",
    "evidence_features": "Features named here are rendered into the reason string with their measured values, so no reason is ever hand-written."
  },
