  "_direction_coherence_note": "A driver hypothesis is accepted only when the demand movement it implies — sign(correlation) x sign(driver movement) — points the same way as the movement actually observed. A driver that correlates and moved but implies the OPPOSITE direction is Rejected: accepting it would state a cause that contradicts the arithmetic."
}
